  "title": "TotalEnergies becomes Official Partner of the Tour de France and specifies its cycling partnerships",
  "summary": "Paris, June 26, 2025 – TotalEnergies announces the signing of an official Tour de France partnership in the Energy category for seasons 2026 to 2028. On the sporting front, the company is delighted that Team TotalEnergies, led by Jean-René Bernaudeau, will take part in the Tour de France 2025.TotalEnergies has also finalized a jersey sponsorship […]",
